@startuml
actor Cron
database "knowledge_base/" as Source
component "update_index.py" as Scanner
component "SHA-256 change detector" as Detector
component "180-word chunker" as Chunker
component "SentenceTransformer" as Embedder
database "FAISS + chunks.json" as Index
database "manifest.json" as Manifest
database "index_updates.jsonl" as Log

Cron -> Scanner: daily at 06:00
Scanner -> Source: scan documents
Scanner -> Detector: current hashes
Detector -> Manifest: compare previous hashes
Detector --> Scanner: added / changed / removed
Scanner -> Chunker: rebuild when changed
Chunker -> Embedder: chunk texts
Embedder -> Index: normalized vectors + metadata
Scanner -> Manifest: model, hashes, counts
Scanner -> Log: timing, changes, size, errors
@enduml
